        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        81.71943664550781,
        288.8233947753906,
        98.575439453125
      ],
      "text": "Commercial serodiagnostics",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        106.32293701171875,
        230.95140075683594,
        119.950439453125
      ],
      "text": "Source of recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        125.36691284179688,
        513.448974609375,
        138.78741455078125
      ],
      "text": "Commercial serodiagnostic tests for diagnosis of tuberculosis: Policy statement.  Geneva,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        141.43243408203125,
        365.38641357421875,
        154.783935546875
      ],
      "text": "World Health Organization, 2011 (WHO/HTM/TB/2011.5)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        165.66290283203125,
        513.460205078125,
        179.2904052734375
      ],
      "text": "It is [therefore] recommended that commercial serodiagnostics should not be used",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        181.659423828125,
        513.4719848632812,
        195.28692626953125
      ],
      "text": "in individuals suspected of active pulmonary or extrapulmonary TB, irrespective",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        197.65594482421875,
        513.4028930664062,
        211.283447265625
      ],
      "text": "of their HIV status. The quality of evidence for commercial serodiagnostic tests",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        213.6524658203125,
        462.08990478515625,
        227.27996826171875
      ],
      "text": "was very low, with harms/risks far outweighing any potential benefit",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        232.76544189453125,
        352.9779052734375,
        246.116943359375
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        256.99591064453125,
        238.85191345214844,
        270.6234130859375
      ],
      "text": "Summary of recent evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        276.10888671875,
        299.1348876953125,
        289.46038818359375
      ],
      "text": "The Panel found no recent data to consider.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        300.33941650390625,
        198.1304168701172,
        313.9669189453125
      ],
      "text": "Other considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        319.4524230957031,
        111.24789428710938,
        332.8039245605469
      ],
      "text": "None",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        343.68292236328125,
        161.72140502929688,
        357.3104248046875
      ],
      "text": "Panel decision",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        362.7959289550781,
        513.46044921875,
        376.1474304199219
      ],
      "text": "Endorsed. No change was made to the recommendation except to include children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        378.79241943359375,
        467.5869445800781,
        392.1439208984375
      ],
      "text": "specifically in the recommendation, which was therefore rephrased as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        405.8174133300781,
        207.19239807128906,
        419.4449157714844
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 6 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        430.6229248046875,
        510.2745361328125,
        444.25042724609375
      ],
      "text": "Commercial serodiagnostics should not be used in children suspected of ac-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        444.42291259765625,
        477.17791748046875,
        458.0504150390625
      ],
      "text": "tive pulmonary or extrapulmonary TB, irrespective of their HIV status",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        464.5019226074219,
        513.4605102539062,
        477.8534240722656
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality of evidence for the use of commercial",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        478.3019104003906,
        187.0328826904297,
        491.6534118652344
      ],
      "text": "serodiagnostics.)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        506.7163391113281,
        226.6634063720703,
        523.5723266601562
      ],
      "text": "Routine HIV testing",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        531.31982421875,
        230.95140075683594,
        544.9473266601562
      ],
      "text": "Source of recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        550.3638305664062,
        513.4490966796875,
        563.7843017578125
      ],
      "text": "WHO policy on collaborative TB/HIV activities: guidelines for national programmes and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        566.3603515625,
        505.9624938964844,
        579.7808227539062
      ],
      "text": "other stakeholders.  Geneva, World Health Organization, 2012 (WHO/HTM/TB/2012.1)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        590.6598510742188,
        513.3798217773438,
        604.287353515625
      ],
      "text": "Routine HIV testing should be offered to all patients with presumptive and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        606.6563110351562,
        157.88040161132812,
        620.2838134765625
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        625.7693481445312,
        329.9893493652344,
        639.120849609375
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        649.9998168945312,
        238.85191345214844,
        663.6273193359375
      ],
      "text": "Summary of recent evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        669.1128540039062,
        513.426025390625,
        682.46435546875
      ],
      "text": "There are no studies that compare the value of testing versus not testing for HIV in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        685.1093139648438,
        513.3800659179688,
        698.4608154296875
      ],
      "text": "various endemic settings. There are strong and consistent data that being HIV-positive",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        701.1058349609375,
        513.4603881835938,
        714.4573364257812
      ],
      "text": "affects the individual’s risk of TB disease, TB-related mortality and most TB management",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        717.1023559570312,
        513.4718627929688,
        730.453857421875
      ],
      "text": "issues, as well as requiring management of HIV. It is therefore an extremely important",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        733.0988159179688,
        440.7689208984375,
        746.4503173828125
      ],
      "text": "test to consider in the diagnostic approach to a child with suspected TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        757.329345703125,
        198.1304168701172,
        770.9568481445312
      ],
      "text": "Other considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        776.4423217773438,
        111.24789428710938,
        789.7938232421875
      ],
      "text": "None",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "96",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
